fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gl-egl/gsteglimage.html#gst_egl_image_can_emulate","fragment":"\n\tgst_egl_image_can_emulate\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.EGLImage.prototype.can_emulate\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.EGLImage.can_emulate\n\nChecks if the given context can emulate format using a limited subset of\nRGB texture formats. Such format is then suitable for importing using\ngst_egl_image_from_dmabuf even when GL supports the video format as\nexternal-only or not at all.\nParameters:\na GstGLContext (must be an EGL context)\na GstVideoFormat\nTRUE if format can be emulated\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nChecks if the given context can emulate format using a limited subset of\nRGB texture formats. Such format is then suitable for importing using\nGstGLEGL.EGLImage.prototype.from_dmabuf even when GL supports the video format as\nexternal-only or not at all.\nParameters:\na GstGL.GLContext (must be an EGL context)\na GstVideo.VideoFormat\ntrue if format can be emulated\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nChecks if the given context can emulate format using a limited subset of\nRGB texture formats. Such format is then suitable for importing using\nGstGLEGL.EGLImage.from_dmabuf even when GL supports the video format as\nexternal-only or not at all.\nParameters:\na GstGL.GLContext (must be an EGL context)\na GstVideo.VideoFormat\nTrue if format can be emulated\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});